# <gitmoji> <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# Common Gitmoji + Conventional Commit prefixes:
#   ✨ feat:      New feature
#   🐛 fix:       Bug fix
#   🚑️ fix:       Critical hotfix
#   🔒️ security:  Security fix
#   ⚡️ perf:      Performance improvement
#   ♻️ refactor:  Code refactoring
#   📝 docs:      Documentation only
#   💄 style:     Formatting / UI styling
#   ✅ test:      Tests
#   📦️ build:     Build / dependencies
#   👷 ci:        CI/CD changes
#   🔧 chore:     Tooling / config / maintenance
#   ⏪️ revert:    Revert previous commit
#   💥 feat!:     Breaking change
#
# Example:
#   🐛 fix(wp-cli): prevent fatal TypeError when listing posts
